WEBVTT

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:18.140
♪ Now, let's get to work ♪

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.060
Emilico, when you first arrived...

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:22.810
♪ Let's make ourselves useful ♪

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:25.230
...you served the Shadows family
without question.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:28.230
♪ Don't fret over trivial matters ♪

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:28.110
I couldn't trust you.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:32.440
But it was because
of the coffee, wasn't it?

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:32.440
♪ For the sake of the Shadows family ♪

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:37.240
And you were made to
drink it again at the debut,

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:41.750
just when you were regaining
a sense of who you really are.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:47.130
Emilico is the type that keeps everything.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:50.300
There should be some
sort of a hint in her room.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:56.050
I <i>will </i>get you back,

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.220
dearly beloved Emilico.

