00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.440
"The Shadows Family's Teachings.

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:36.490
Before the debut,
shadows may not interact with others.

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:39.820
One must read this book
to learn the rules to live by.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:42.820
Lord Grandfather is absolute.

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:45.240
Always have your living doll with you.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:48.540
Cherish your contact
with your living doll.

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.000
Maintain your dignity as a master

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.710
while improving the
chemistry with your face."

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:59.590
It also provides information on the
house's wings and the Star Bearers.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:05.260
As for soot, there's a section on how
it's emitted due to negative feelings

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:09.230
and how scorches spawn
if you don't clean, but that's about it.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:11.690
There are other books,

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:15.230
but they explain how to
become a more cultured noble.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:20.150
They don't teach children
what's really important.

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:25.410
The living doll's manual
emphasizes loyalty to Shadows House

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:28.870
and the importance of being a living doll.

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.040
It also covers scorches,

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:34.250
but it doesn't appear
Emilico read that far.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:40.010
That should be hung up.

00:03:44.220 --> 00:03:47.600
She always kept it in her pocket.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:50.930
I feel sorry for you, too.

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:54.900
May you one day play with Emilico again.

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:02.450
Crash landing.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.250
"'Don't Fret' Notebook"?

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.880
Emilico hid something from me?

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.800
Forgive me, but I must read this.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:28.510
This notebook is for writing down
things I should not think about

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:31.680
so I can forget all about them.

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:34.900
Wouldn't that make her
remember them even more?

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.980
That's just like her.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:40.110
"Great hall major cleaning
with the other living dolls.

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:44.400
Team members: Mia, Rosemary, Lou."

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.240
Should she really be thinking about that?

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:50.240
I might as well use this as a diary, too.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:52.910
Now she's making excuses.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:55.790
The phantom mayhem
that Emilico told me about

00:04:55.790 --> 00:05:00.050
isn't mentioned in
"The Shadows Family's Teachings."

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.090
"Night watch duty."

00:05:02.090 --> 00:05:04.760
So she had to do that as punishment?

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:07.930
I wish she would've told me the truth.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:11.970
I didn't want Mistress Kate
to get angry, so I kept it a secret.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:15.810
Hey! That makes me seem ill-tempered.

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:43.670
Soot sickness? Drink lots of water?

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:46.430
That's how Rosemary was cured?

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:52.970
You want me to drink this water?

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:56.810
That's right. You'll listen to
what Kate wants, won't you?

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:59.560
Of course.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.110
Based on her notebook,

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:11.410
soot sickness seems to be
a sort of mental derangement.

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:16.620
But those who drink the coffee
fall into a state of insane loyalty.

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:22.380
The symptoms may differ slightly,
but they are both forms of insanity.

00:06:22.380 --> 00:06:27.300
That coffee was most
likely doctored with soot.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:34.260
Um, I don't think I can drink any more.

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:38.810
Keep drinking.

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:44.780
Why hide the truth about
soot from us younger shadows?

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:47.900
Is it because if we knew
about soot sickness

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.990
and noticed how our dolls change

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.530
after drinking the coffee,

00:06:51.530 --> 00:06:54.080
we'd try to cure them?

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.800
Emilico.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:08.420
How do you feel about
what happened to Rum?

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:14.260
Why are you asking me that now?

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.810
Drink.

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.730
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:22.940
I don't want you to forget.

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:27.320
Emilico, you had regained
your sense of self.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:36.410
Emilico.

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:40.580
Forgive me!

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.220
That's enough!

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:02.640
You don't have to drink any more!

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:05.980
You must forgive, Kate!
That must've been difficult!

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.150
It's not that.

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.240
I don't understand.

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:12.240
I remember.

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:15.950
I remember what
happened in the debut hall.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:21.750
I can't believe it, and I'm so very sad.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:26.750
But no matter how much
I think about that day,

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:30.420
the only feelings that
come to me are those of joy.

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:34.930
How could I feel joy
when Rum's no longer here?

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:37.220
She tried so very hard.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:41.310
It's...

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:44.020
...too much to bear!

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.150
Feel better now?

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:56.280
Yes, ma'am.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.790
You should rest.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:03.710
Listen, Emilico.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:08.590
Kate is going to tell you
something just between us.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.220
Such a tedious task.

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.930
We must all take turns.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:22.020
And is it not a delight to portray
fine nobles beloved by the people?

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:26.980
The soot train!

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:29.110
Visitors from the Shadows family!

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:31.780
I trust the offerings are prepared?

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:35.150
Why, you could cut this air with a knife.

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:38.070
Though it's not as thick
as Grandfather's soot.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:41.540
Breathing the soot from
the soot coal each day

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:46.460
prevents normal thinking,
making the villagers easy to manipulate.

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:53.880
We have plenty of soot coal for you.
Make good use of it.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:57.340
Thank you.
We so eagerly awaited this gift.

00:09:57.340 --> 00:09:59.180
Let's get to it.

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:02.060
Yes, lord. This way, if you please.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:19.660
Come now. No need to be so nervous.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:22.620
What a fine complexion.

00:10:22.620 --> 00:10:26.160
Let us choose more girls this time.

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:35.710
This time, the prestigious
assignments go to these three.

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:38.970
This is the ceremony
for entering our manor.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:40.090
Now,

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:42.510
drink.

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:54.900
A little bitter, is it not?

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:58.400
Congratulations.
The Shadows family welcomes you.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:02.240
You are the pride of your families.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:09.870
How wonderful that
your daughter was chosen.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:14.710
Yes, she'll live a life of privilege,
working at the manor.

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:18.050
What would we do without the manor?

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:33.110
The joyous birth of some
new shadows draws near!

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:36.280
May you become fine, young living dolls.

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:42.410
There are several villages
surrounding the manor.

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:44.830
You were born in one of them,

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:49.200
but your memory was erased before
you were brought to Shadows House.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:53.290
Emilico, you're human.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:56.000
Shadows House has wronged us.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:12:01.630
For both shadows and living dolls,
this place is a prison.

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:04.300
It must be bewildering.

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:10.520
Umm... May I borrow a mirror?

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:14.350
I always wanted to see a human!

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:17.980
So this is what they look like?
They look just like a living doll!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:22.860
No, you weren't listening.
There's no such thing as a living doll.

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:24.990
Oh, right!

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:29.450
It's all so confusing, but...

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:33.620
I believe you, Mistress Kate!

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:38.840
If we're all human, I'd like to help
everyone return to their villages!

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:11.370
Emilico, a word, please.

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.920
Emilico?

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:26.930
It was before the debut.

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:32.470
John saw a living doll go tumbling
down while gazing out the window.

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:36.400
Wanting to see more,
John snuck outside without Shaun noticing.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:43.150
Emilico, you tried to protect
that which you treasure.

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:45.320
That is progress.

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:47.110
It's...

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:48.780
...difficult to explain,

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:51.950
but John fell for Kate at that moment.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:59.040
Please come to John's room
if you'd consider getting engaged to him.

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.760
You came!

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:08.890
So you agree to get engaged--

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:10.720
Emilico is gone!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:11.850
Huh?

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:14.470
Kate freed her from their brainwashing.

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:15.730
Brainwashing?

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:18.810
Yes. John, please listen.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:22.570
Emilico and the other
living dolls are human.

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:25.190
They were brainwashed by Shadows House.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.780
Wh-What are you talking about, Kate?

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:29.870
Living dolls are human?

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.120
They're brainwashed?

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:32.910
It's true!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:37.330
After Kate freed Emilico's mind
and told her the truth,

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:40.000
she completely vanished.

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:44.550
So Shaun... he's human, too?

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.380
Yes.

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:51.800
I'm done cleaning the bathroom.

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:55.310
John, think carefully.

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:58.390
You must've noticed Shaun
acting a bit differently.

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.480
Different?

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:03.440
Shaun, why are you wearing glasses?

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:05.570
So I can work more efficiently.

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:08.320
Of course, I'll remove
them outside your room.

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:12.370
You said you'd always try
to match how John looked.

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:13.830
As you wish.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:15.830
You're so... compliant?!

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:19.000
You could at least argue a little bit!

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:22.880
You're like you were when we first met.

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:28.340
Come to think of it,
Shaun often used to lecture John.

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:30.800
But not anymore.

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:35.890
What's this forlorn feeling?
It's as if his heart's gone cold.

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:41.810
Shaun, you know you don't have to
pledge your loyalty to Shadows House?

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:48.690
Master John, Shadows House is absolute!

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:53.070
Shaun, you never glared
at John like that before!

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:55.580
What's wrong?! Snap out of it!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:56.370
Please, calm down--

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:59.540
Listen, Shaun. Emilico has disappeared!

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:02.000
That's right. You must be shocked!

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.330
It's terrible news!

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.290
John is going to look for her.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.920
And he's going with or without you!

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:11.430
It's forbidden to leave your room
without your living doll.

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:15.010
When did you become so coldhearted?!

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:17.010
John, stop it!

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:19.350
Mistress Kate, what are you doing here?

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:21.230
Let go, Kate!

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:23.980
We're going to settle this, man to man.

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:26.820
Please, stop this! My face will get--

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.940
Who cares about your face?

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:32.950
John wants the old Shaun back!

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:34.620
Look at John!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:35.780
He's crying!

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:37.910
Do you know why?

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:40.700
Because John's heart aches!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:43.500
Stop!

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:48.170
I'm the one feeling pain!

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.180
Now that's the real Shaun.

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:56.720
However... it's still not enough!

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:22.080
I've failed as a living doll, haven't I?

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:26.080
To do something so foolish to my master...

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:30.960
That's because...

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:34.010
...you're human, Shaun.

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:49.150
Where could Kate be?

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:53.740
Louise had something
wonderful to show her.

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:10.130
What are you doing?

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.710
Louise!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:15.470
Kate, John, you're just awful.

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:18.680
You were trying to
exclude Louise, weren't you?!

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:21.140
No! We were in a hurry!

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:23.770
Take your quarrel elsewhere.

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:27.520
Forgive the sudden intrusion.

00:18:27.520 --> 00:18:31.440
But there's something you need to hear.

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:36.200
Emilico is gone?!

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:41.700
Yes. Please help Kate look for her!

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:45.750
Who was Emilico, again?

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:48.330
Kate's living doll.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:49.790
What an odd name.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:51.500
But enough about that. Look!

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:55.550
Louise wanted to find you
and show you this.

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:04.850
Sad face.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:07.560
Happiest face in the world!

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:09.100
Fabulous, isn't it?

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:11.270
Louise has complete control!

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:16.740
My power is physical, but it seems there
are also powers that affect the mind.

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:20.530
Hold on. What do you mean, control?

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:22.780
Kate will explain later.

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:25.580
But, Patrick, now's not the time.

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:28.330
Louise, were you even listening to Kate?

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:32.500
Of course. You were talking
about your living doll.

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:38.420
Speaking of dolls, Louise saw a really
tall veiled doll on the way here.

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:41.010
It had a cart with a big bundle on it.

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:44.180
That was probably a living doll.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:47.520
A living doll... on a cart?

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:51.730
And being the clever shadow she is,
Louise figured out who it was!

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:54.520
So who was it?

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:57.940
Who do you think it was?

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:15.170
Wh-Who are you?!
And why are you doing this?!

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:19.130
Greetings. Please forgive
the heavy-handed tactics.

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:20.050
Who are you?

00:20:20.050 --> 00:20:23.640
Please take this off! I can't see a thing!

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:27.180
The tea leaves are dancing
about as if they feel the heat.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:30.480
You must start by pouring
boiling water most vigorously

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.940
if you wish to brew the finest tea.

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:34.350
Please answer me!

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:38.780
Who are you? Why are you doing this?!

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:42.740
Now, all there is to do is wait.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:45.070
Edward abducted Emilico?

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:47.780
His suit was visible under his robe.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:52.160
Edward is the only one
who wears such vulgar attire.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:56.290
There can be no doubt.
Edward must mistrust Kate.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:21:00.340
After all, Kate hid her soot power
from him until the debut.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:06.510
He's likely trying to see whether
Kate is loyal to Shadows House.

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:08.930
He's pigheaded, all right.

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:11.810
That lout didn't tell John
the labyrinth's rules,

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:13.770
so his clothes got dirty!

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:16.940
You should've seen Shaun's
downcast look when he saw that!

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.780
Louise detests Edward, too!

00:21:19.780 --> 00:21:23.990
Those trees he used in the
debut labyrinth were full of thorns!

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:28.330
They could have scratched
Lou's beautiful face!

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:30.950
Ricky suffered even worse!

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:34.460
Edward tried to crush him with a boulder!

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:39.800
Shirley's failure at the debut was,
no doubt, Edward's doing!

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:43.420
Patrick will help.

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:48.100
Louise detests Edward, too,
so she will gladly lend a hand.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:49.930
Louise.

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:54.850
The living dolls were quite
helpful during the debut.

00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:58.270
It's time the shadows pay that debt.

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:04.240
Now that that's settled,
we must move quickly.

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:09.240
We're dealing with Edward, after all.
Who knows what he will do to Emilico?

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.250
Emilico...

00:22:24.840 --> 00:22:28.550
<i>No ash, no, just shadow</i>

00:22:28.550 --> 00:22:32.930
<i>A no-"I" body, like a dolly</i>

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:36.850
<i>I'm hollow, where'd I go?</i>

00:22:36.850 --> 00:22:39.650
<i>Nobody knows</i>

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:44.030
<i>A murky "I" with black-hole eyes</i>

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:47.700
<i>A mimic, oh my! I'm in disguise?</i>

00:22:47.700 --> 00:22:50.240
<i>"Thank you"? Thank who?</i>

00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:53.870
<i>Every answer is true</i>

00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:57.500
<i>If I am no one</i>

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:01.380
<i>And I can do nothing</i>

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:04.960
<i>Is it a waste to keep living?</i>

00:23:04.960 --> 00:23:08.340
<i>Is it wrong to go on?</i>

00:23:08.340 --> 00:23:13.260
<i>What's missing here is me, me, me</i>

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:15.850
<i>Without a self</i>

00:23:15.850 --> 00:23:20.440
<i>Swept away before anyone see, see, sees</i>

00:23:20.440 --> 00:23:23.270
<i>Like dust from the shelf</i>

00:23:23.270 --> 00:23:27.820
<i>Neither happy nor sad</i>

00:23:27.820 --> 00:23:30.660
<i>Don't feel good or bad</i>

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:32.700
<i>Not up to snuff</i>

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:38.250
<i>I can't even bluff</i>

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:41.960
<i>Would you believe this stuff?</i>

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:51.970
Next episode,
"To Lord Grandfather's Wing."

